Subject: Re: {Suspected Spam} [distance-sampling] multi species line-transect model with landcover types as detectability covariates
Message-ID: <63rpYPYxPRY.9sfdQuhWAwAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <63rpYPYxPRY.F2r67e5UAwAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
